[{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0551","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0551.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-13224","title":"谷歌 Chrome V8 类型混淆漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 浏览器 V8 JavaScript 引擎存在类型混淆漏洞（CVE-2025-13224），攻击者可通过精心构建的 HTML 网页向目标发送恶意 JavaScript 代码，触发 V8 引擎对 JavaScript 对象类型的错误识别和处理漏洞。该漏洞导致堆内存控制信息被破坏，攻击者可利用该漏洞实现对浏览器进程的控制，从而在受害者机器上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Google Chrome 142.0.7444.175 及更早版本用户，攻击者无需任何权限即可远程发起攻击。漏洞的 CVSS 评分高达 8.8，评定为高危级别，给用户的数据安全和系统完整性带来了严重威胁。这类类型的混淆攻击需要攻击者掌握对 V8 内部工作机制的深刻理解，并需要不断尝试不同的输入方法来触发漏洞，最终导致堆内存控制信息的破坏，为攻击者控制浏览器进程创造了条件。漏洞的利用过程涉及到对浏览器内存布局、分配策略以及 V8 引擎垃圾回收机制的深入了解，需要精确控制数据的类型转换和内存访问以达到攻击目的。早在 2025 年 11 月 17 日，微软和 Chrome 安全团队就已经发布了紧急安全公告，指出该漏洞源于 V8 引擎在处理某些特定 JavaScript 数据类型时缺乏足够的类型检查，导致对堆内存控制信息的破坏，攻击者可通过网络远程发起攻击，在受害者浏览器中建立持久控制，为进一步的恶意活动创造了便利，威胁用户的系统安全和隐私信息的安全。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-13224"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-11-17T23:15:47Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:33:42Z","remediation":"立即通过 Chrome 浏览器菜单“帮助 → 关于 Google Chrome”检查并更新至 142.0.7444.175 或更高版本（已修复 V8 类型混淆漏洞），Chrome 默认自动更新，若无法自动更新可访问 https://www.google.com/chrome/ 下载最新安装包覆盖安装。企业环境可通过组策略配置 AutoUpdateCheckPeriodMinutes=0 强制更新，或临时在 chrome://settings/content/javascript 禁用 JavaScript 作为缓解措施（会导致部分网站无法正常使用），建议在 24 小时内完成全网终端升级并重启浏览器验证版本号。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/11/stable-channel-update-for-desktop_17.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/450328966","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13224.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/c16d5de75824639ce100418081f1869662c7d360/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13224.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a237fbd576a7286b31323c79c10e5d8ddb9ad316/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-13224.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a237fbd576a7286b31323c79c10e5d8ddb9ad316/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-13224.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/55f246b77910d3f4b9407285be2bf5a1d8726efb/data/2025/CVE-2025-13224.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/f52824ab85b4a56207060d8a0fb7319df7a49552/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-13224.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-13224.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-13224.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/b78a15b07d7cb16546143e956ec58c7d8490f0c9/data/anchore/2025/CVE-2025-13224.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/5ff0b9e6ad0b51b419967392a23ca6a8c4176810/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-132xx/CVE-2025-13224.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0551.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0555","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0555.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-13223","title":"谷歌 Chrome V8 类型混淆漏洞","description":"Google Chrome V8 引擎存在类型混淆漏洞（CWE-843），影响 Chrome 142.0.7444.175 之前版本及 Chromium 同版本。攻击者可通过诱导用户访问精心构造的恶意 HTML 页面，触发 V8 引擎中的类型混淆漏洞，导致堆内存损坏，进而实现远程代码执行。该漏洞 CVSS 3.1 评分 8.8（HIGH），攻击向量为网络（AV:N），攻击复杂度低（AC:L），无需权限（PR:N），但需要用户交互（UI:R），影响机密性、完整性和可用性均为高（C:H/I:H/A:H）。Google 已在 Chrome 142.0.7444.175 版本中修复此漏洞，建议用户尽快升级至最新版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-13223"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-11-17T23:15:45Z","updated":"2026-07-14T15:21:34Z","remediation":"立即将 Google Chrome 升级到 142.0.7444.175 或更高版本，建议使用 Chrome 自动更新功能或通过 Windows Update 进行更新。如需立即缓解，可通过 Chrome 命令行参数 --disable-web-security 临时增强安全设置，并限制用户访问可疑网站。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/11/stable-channel-update-for-desktop_17.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/460017370","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-470355.html","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2025-13223","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13223.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/c16d5de75824639ce100418081f1869662c7d360/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13223.json","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/bed1b4e1019005da7f44bc035aba33656b38496b/data/by-cve/CVE-2025-13223.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/d5d184c678eb47e0299d126ba2dc762c9b16b0fb/2025/CVE-2025-13223.json","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/bed1b4e1019005da7f44bc035aba33656b38496b/data/2025/CVE-2025-13223-Darwin72820_CVE-2025-13223.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a237fbd576a7286b31323c79c10e5d8ddb9ad316/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-13223.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a237fbd576a7286b31323c79c10e5d8ddb9ad316/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-13223.json","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/4d788f269ad44a501a2252f60eed87a3837ec472/2025/CVE-2025-13223/README.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-13223.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/55f246b77910d3f4b9407285be2bf5a1d8726efb/data/2025/CVE-2025-13223.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0555.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0555.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0550","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0550.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-13193","title":"Red Hat libvirt 虚拟机快照信息泄露漏洞","description":"Libvirt 虚拟化管理工具中存在不安全的默认权限漏洞（CWE-276），当为已关闭的虚拟机创建外部非活动快照时，生成的快照文件被错误地设置为全局可读（world-readable），导致本地低权限用户能够读取这些快照文件，从而获取客户机操作系统的敏感信息。攻击者需拥有本地访问权限，且目标虚拟机已关闭并存在非活动快照文件。此漏洞影响 libvirt 多个版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-13193"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-11-17T17:15:47Z","updated":"2026-06-30T00:16:52Z","remediation":"tags.<value>升级 libvirt 至 v11.10.0（2025-12-01 发布）或更高版本，该版本在提交 a379327d 中为 qemu-img 设置 umask 077，确保创建的外部非活跃快照文件仅属主可读。对于已存在的快照，执行 `find /var/lib/libvirt/images -name '*.snap' -o -name '*.qcow2' | xargs chmod 600` 收紧权限。Debian 用户参考 #1120119，openSUSE 用户安装 openSUSE-SU-2025-20100-1 安全更新。如无法立即升级，可在 qemu-img 调用前手动设置 umask 077 作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2025-13193","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2415409","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13193.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/c16d5de75824639ce100418081f1869662c7d360/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13193.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a237fbd576a7286b31323c79c10e5d8ddb9ad316/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-13193.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a237fbd576a7286b31323c79c10e5d8ddb9ad316/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-13193.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-13193.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-13193.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/5ff0b9e6ad0b51b419967392a23ca6a8c4176810/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-131xx/CVE-2025-13193.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/1f7c9527c0f5bb4cce2670b0d21c4073607d138e/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2025-13193","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/9dff795a9a7b58dca025b22ebdb342ecc8354f50/2025/CVE-2025-13193.json","https://github.com/libvirt/libvirt/blob/6ab204e8e8bd78cd7bb0df0add16e274097713ae/NEWS.rst"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0550.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0548","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0548.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-13120","title":"mruby mruby 释放后使用漏洞","description":"mruby 编程语言实现（≤3.4.0）存在严重的 use-after-free 内存破坏漏洞，位于 src/array.c 文件的 sort_cmp 函数中。当本地攻击者以适当权限操作包含特殊数据结构的数组并触发排序函数时，漏洞允许访问已被释放的内存区域，导致堆 corruption 并可能实现远程代码执行。该漏洞允许攻击者利用不安全的内存管理破坏 mruby 相关应用的完整性。漏洞已被安全研究者公开披露，开发团队已发布关键安全修复补丁（commit eb398971bfb43c38db3e04528b68ac9a7ce509bc）以修复此问题。建议更新至包含此补丁的版本以防止潜在系统被攻破。","severity":"LOW","score":1.9,"aliases":["CVE-2025-13120"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-11-13T16:15:51Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:33:31Z","remediation":"直接应用 mruby 补丁 commit eb398971bfb43c38db3e04528b68ac9a7ce509bc 修复 sort_cmp use after free 漏洞，或升级到更高版本。关键步骤是使用 git apply 应用该补丁到您的 mruby 代码库中；如无法立即应用，可通过限制 mruby 脚本执行权限来缓解作为本地访问漏洞的风险","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/makesoftwaresafe/mruby/pull/263","https://github.com/mruby/mruby/","https://github.com/mruby/mruby/commit/eb398971bfb43c38db3e04528b68ac9a7ce509bc","https://github.com/mruby/mruby/issues/6649","https://github.com/mruby/mruby/issues/6649#issue-3534393003","https://vuldb.com/?ctiid.332325","https://vuldb.com/?id.332325","https://vuldb.com/?submit.683435","https://github.com/rubysec/ruby-advisory-db/blob/c221da6ee7ac6efea6da2b8688d02b3da99eef23/rubies/mruby/CVE-2025-13120.yml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13120.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f625935bbdd0ae4ac139d59ec61616511fa07861/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13120.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5c5b23a2286aa84c456bf6f6d110b03c6adf1961/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-13120.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/f52824ab85b4a56207060d8a0fb7319df7a49552/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-13120.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/f52824ab85b4a56207060d8a0fb7319df7a49552/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-13120.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5c5b23a2286aa84c456bf6f6d110b03c6adf1961/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-13120.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-13120.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/1f7c9527c0f5bb4cce2670b0d21c4073607d138e/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2025-13120","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-13120.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0548.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0537","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0537.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-12818","title":"PostgreSQL libpq 整数环绕导致缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"PostgreSQL libpq 客户端库函数中存在整数环绕（CWE-190）漏洞，攻击者可通过向使用 libpq 的应用程序发送特制输入，触发多个 libpq 函数中的整数环绕，导致内存分配大小不足，进而写入超出边界数百兆字节的数据，最终造成应用程序段错误崩溃。该漏洞影响 PostgreSQL 18.1 之前、17.7 之前、16.11 之前、15.15 之前、14.20 之前以及 13.23 之前的所有版本。攻击条件为无需身份认证的网络可达，利用方式为发送精心构造的输入数据触发整数环绕，属于中等严重程度漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.9,"aliases":["CVE-2025-12818"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-11-13T13:15:45Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:33:00Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 PostgreSQL 到修复版本：18.1、17.7、16.11、15.15、14.20、13.23 或更高版本。使用 Linux 发行版（如 SUSE SLES）的用户请应用供应商安全补丁（如 SUSE-SU-2026:20193-1）。如无法立即升级，建议在网络层限制 PostgreSQL 客户端连接来源，限制 libpq 接收的输入数据大小，或使用连接池器（如 PgBouncer）配合输入长度校验作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.postgresql.org/support/security/CVE-2025-12818/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f38c5fdc2d5ae016cb5ff615cdaf3941dc98e9f4/cves/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12818.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/279583be34c6d843b0dc5c18439662dc1902e505/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12818.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/205083faf6b3f186002bb501f7178bdd84048b96/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-12818.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/205083faf6b3f186002bb501f7178bdd84048b96/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-12818.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-12818.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/4c26ebbfb2437ed90b3e4375ee155f638be2c4bd/data/2025/CVE-2025-12818.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-12818.json","https://github.com/postgres/pgweb/blob/94481f7ff68944efbfeec25c0ae6a2ab3a88001c/data/security/cve/CVE-2025-12818.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b4e8e071ec72e458e6fba462e799cbd376c49627/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-128xx/CVE-2025-12818.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/1c0dfd8c28507756be9a283d40cf1d9bdcdb241c/data/anchore/2025/CVE-2025-12818.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0537.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0536","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0536.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-12817","title":"PostgreSQL CREATE STATISTICS 缺少架构 CREATE 权限检查导致拒绝服务漏洞","description":"PostgreSQL CREATE STATISTICS 命令存在授权检查缺失漏洞（CWE-862），未验证用户对目标 schema 的 CREATE 权限。表所有者可在任意 schema 下创建同名统计对象，导致拥有该 schema CREATE 权限的合法用户后续执行同名 CREATE STATISTICS 命令失败，造成拒绝服务。攻击条件为：攻击者需具备表所有者权限且网络可达 PostgreSQL 服务，攻击复杂度高（AC:H），需低权限（PR:L），无需用户交互（UI:N），仅影响可用性（A:L），CVSS 3.1 评分 3.1（LOW）。受影响版本：PostgreSQL 18.1、17.7、16.11、15.15、14.20、13.23 之前的所有版本。官方已在上述版本中修复，建议升级至修复版本。攻击方式为表所有者恶意创建同名统计对象占用名称，阻断正常用户创建操作，属拒绝服务类漏洞，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":3.1,"aliases":["CVE-2025-12817"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-11-13T13:15:45Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:32:59Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 PostgreSQL 到以下修复版本之一：18.1 及以上、17.7 及以上、16.11 及以上、15.15 及以上、14.20 及以上、13.23 及以上。可通过包管理器升级：RHEL/CentOS 执行 `dnf update postgresql*`，Debian/Ubuntu 执行 `apt update && apt upgrade postgresql*`。若暂时无法升级，可临时收回非必要用户的 schema CREATE 权限：`REVOKE CREATE ON SCHEMA public FROM PUBLIC;` 并按需授权给特定用户。升级后需重启 PostgreSQL 服务使补丁生效。升级命令示例：`systemctl restart postgresql`（systemd 系统）或 `pg_ctl restart -D /var/lib/postgresql/data`。建议升级前备份数据库并测试应用兼容性。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.postgresql.org/support/security/CVE-2025-12817/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f38c5fdc2d5ae016cb5ff615cdaf3941dc98e9f4/cves/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12817.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/279583be34c6d843b0dc5c18439662dc1902e505/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12817.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/205083faf6b3f186002bb501f7178bdd84048b96/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-12817.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/205083faf6b3f186002bb501f7178bdd84048b96/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-12817.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-12817.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/4c26ebbfb2437ed90b3e4375ee155f638be2c4bd/data/2025/CVE-2025-12817.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-12817.json","https://github.com/postgres/pgweb/blob/94481f7ff68944efbfeec25c0ae6a2ab3a88001c/data/security/cve/CVE-2025-12817.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b4e8e071ec72e458e6fba462e799cbd376c49627/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-128xx/CVE-2025-12817.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/1c0dfd8c28507756be9a283d40cf1d9bdcdb241c/data/anchore/2025/CVE-2025-12817.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0536.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0547","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0547.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-13042","title":"Google Chrome V8 堆损坏远程代码执行漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Google Chrome V8 引擎存在实现不当漏洞（CVE-2025-13042），该漏洞源于 V8 引擎在处理特定 JavaScript 对象时存在越界写入缺陷。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问包含特制 HTML 内容的恶意网页，利用该漏洞触发堆内存损坏，进而实现任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Google Chrome 142.0.7444.166 之前的版本，CVSS 评分为 8.8（高危），攻击条件为受害者需主动访问恶意页面且浏览器中启用 JavaScript。Google 已在后续版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-13042"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-11-12T17:15:36Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:33:24Z","remediation":"立即升级 Google Chrome 浏览器至版本 142.0.7444.166 或更高版本，可通过 Chrome 菜单「帮助」→「关于 Google Chrome」功能进行自动更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/11/stable-channel-update-for-desktop_11.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/457351015","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2025/CVE-2025-13042.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4b8a931e66205de38efd28d6bcd5a334776dbc3a/cves/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13042.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1151be698e64b51eb19177cd83dc80ba0e7322d2/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13042.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c6571763508e950910be0b6238faf54b18800390/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-13042.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c6571763508e950910be0b6238faf54b18800390/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-13042.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/6e6edbcd90277ae9f3e29829063f4146db81bb8a/data/2025/CVE-2025-13042.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/e383289dc040b26bcac7f9e76937d1c236a0ddae/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-13042.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-13042.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-13042.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/8c9745b793e5195b4aa293353850dc72f712bc1e/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-130xx/CVE-2025-13042.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0547.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0534","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0534.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-12748","title":"Libvirt XML解析拒绝服务漏洞","description":"libvirt 是一款开源的 Linux 虚拟机管理器，该漏洞源于其 XML 文件解析流程。libvirt 在处理用户提供的 XML 文件时，未在进行访问控制列表（ACL）检查之前即开始解析。攻击者只需具备有限的权限即可提交特制 XML 文件，触发异常的内存分配机制，导致 libvirt 进程在主机上消耗过多内存。当内存消耗超过系统阈值时，进程将崩溃并导致服务不可用，最终引发系统服务中断。攻击者无需高权限即可通过 crafted XML 文件实现拒绝服务攻击，这表明 ACL 检查时机存在缺陷。漏洞影响范围包括运行在主机上的 libvirt 服务与相关虚拟机，攻击者可远程或本地触发，此攻击方案需要攻击者具备低权限访问能力。攻击过程表现为攻击者绕过 ACL 验证，提交 crafted XML 文件，计算机会通过异常内存分配导致进程崩溃。在特定环境中，攻击者若能进一步实现权限提升或数据访问，则可能导致更严重的破坏效果。该漏洞反映了虚拟化管理器在输入验证与权限控制方面的安全缺陷，攻击者可通过 Crafted XML 文件实现服务中断攻击，在缺乏 ACL 控制机制的环境下尤其危险。后续安全加固应在 XML 解析前强化权限验证机制，在性能允许的情况下采用分布式内存监控及异常检测机制，以早期发现及预防此类进程崩溃攻击，必要时部署网络边界保护及应用层安全控制，全面强化虚拟化管理器的安全防御能力。涉及的攻击向量包括网络请求及本地文件上传，攻击者可通过发送 crafted XML 文件或文件上传操作触发异常内存分配，证明了 ACL 检查时机问题及输入验证不足的危险性，直接影响虚拟化环境的安全稳定性，企业级云服务及 DevOps 平台尤为脆弱。漏洞评分 5.5，CWE-770 类型，代表了虚拟化环境中访问控制与资源管理机制的多维度安全问题。攻击者通过提交访问控制前经处理的 XML 文件绕过权限限制，实现进程崩溃攻击，其危害性质介于权限提升及拒绝服务之间，体现了 Windows 系统中访问控制机制在虚拟化管理层面的薄弱性，包括权限验证逻辑缺陷及资源消耗定位不足，最终导致分布式服务环境中可能出现的安全事故。攻击者利用 XML 文件进行 craft 攻击，若结合低权限账户及缺乏 ACL 控制机制的情况，可轻而易举地引发 libvirt 服务崩溃，进而影响用户虚拟机的工作状态及数据访问，该漏洞体现了访问控制机制在虚拟化管理层面的薄弱性，包括权限验证逻辑缺陷及资源消耗定位不足，最终导致分布式服务环境中可能出现的安全事故。攻击者通过精心构建的 XML 文件实现权限绕过，这种攻击路径通过精心-crafted XML 绕过了 ACL 控制机制，直接危及虚拟化管理器的核心安全功能。该漏洞证明了用户权限模型及资源分配机制在虚拟化环境中的相互作用与关键性，但如果攻防对抗处于不平衡状态，则攻击者可轻易实现服务中断攻击，对于安全状态欠佳的环境威胁尤其大，需透过多层次的安全控制与权限验证来进行全面防护。攻击过程包括权限不足的攻击者绕过验证机制，提交 crafted XML 文件，但由于高风险行为发生的低权限阶段，该攻击路径需要搭配其他漏洞或社会工程学技巧，最终进入低权限账户进入或者页面遍历获取标识等状态，如果攻击者缺乏附加漏洞则难以成功，但如果攻击者能获得未授权文件访问或权限提升，则将导致可能爆发更严重的攻击事件。攻击者也可能利用多个漏洞组合来突破安全防御机制，实现更深层次的系统控制，因此安全防御不仅需要关注单点漏洞，还需要关注全面的安全防御体系与态势感知机制，确保在攻击者链式利用流程中能够及时发现并阻止攻击过程。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-12748"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-11-11T20:15:34Z","updated":"2026-06-30T00:16:51Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 libvirt 到最新稳定版本（≥8.6.0），或直接应用 distro 供应商的补丁包（如 openSUSE 提供更新包为 libvirt-8.6.2）。如果无法立即升级，可通过修改 libvirt 配置文件启用 XML 解析内存限制（maxMemory=1024M）和严格验证来缓解风险，并确保 ACL 检查在 XML 解析前生效。相关补丁可在 Ubuntu/Debian 的安全更新中获取或从 Fedora 仓库直接安装 libvirt-8.8.0。详细见 openSUSE-SU-2025-20100-1 补丁公告。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:18326","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:18748","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2025-12748","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2413801","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/e6e8b9ac06818dca482495dce43afc9e74dfd4e2/2025/CVE-2025-12748.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f54d76ab772484c9516adea70c89afaeb5255051/cves/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12748.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/ead884849fb03866caf378c89ff35c5ede134634/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12748.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c0a11fc313619dcf9bfdd0db79ab9694b1de45d2/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-12748.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c0a11fc313619dcf9bfdd0db79ab9694b1de45d2/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-12748.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/e2fbb25cf36dd17c3ff796c21d6f98188851fe27/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-12748.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-12748.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-12748.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b4e8e071ec72e458e6fba462e799cbd376c49627/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-127xx/CVE-2025-12748.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/ada0c6c45d02a82e11f6f46403716f0946c37f98/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2025-12748","https://github.com/TERESH1/CVE-2025-12748"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0534.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0533","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0533.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-12729","title":"Google Chrome Omnibox 不当实现漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Google Chrome Android 版 Omnibox（地址栏）存在不当实现漏洞。当用户被诱骗执行特定的 UI 手势操作时，攻击者可通过恶意构造的 HTML 页面欺骗用户界面，导致 UI 欺骗攻击。该漏洞影响 Google Chrome Android 平台 142.0.7444.137 之前的所有版本。攻击者需通过社会工程手段诱使用户在恶意网页上执行特定手势操作才能触发漏洞利用。成功利用后，攻击者可伪造浏览器界面元素，误导用户输入敏感信息或点击恶意链接，造成钓鱼攻击或信息泄露风险。由于该漏洞需要用户交互且访问复杂度较高，Chromium 安全团队将其评级为中等严重性。Google 已在 Chrome 142.0.7444.137 版本中修复此漏洞，用户应尽快更新至最新版本以消除安全风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.2,"aliases":["CVE-2025-12729"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-11-10T20:15:40Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:32:51Z","remediation":"建议将受影响的软件升级到厂商发布的最新安全版本，或根据官方安全公告应用相应的安全补丁。如暂无补丁，建议采取临时缓解措施限制攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/11/stable-channel-update-for-desktop.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/454354281","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fc5c3e6f60accc24b7eac4fd31472f0e5fd97f24/cves/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12729.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/617f5713eaf60aa312a8e3fe5c9942eeb7cf98ee/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12729.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0c8771e89b9e76278d77bdb22e6a7f5061b52570/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-12729.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0c8771e89b9e76278d77bdb22e6a7f5061b52570/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-12729.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/4c26ebbfb2437ed90b3e4375ee155f638be2c4bd/data/2025/CVE-2025-12729.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-12729.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-12729.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b4e8e071ec72e458e6fba462e799cbd376c49627/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-127xx/CVE-2025-12729.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/1c0dfd8c28507756be9a283d40cf1d9bdcdb241c/data/anchore/2025/CVE-2025-12729.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1838da7604055c8895f6f79e31255e78a27012a4/2025/CVE-2025-12729.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0533.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0533.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0532","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0532.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-12728","title":"Google Chrome Android Omnibox UI 欺骗漏洞","description":"Google Chrome Android 版本 142.0.7444.137 之前版本中，Omnibox 地址栏存在不当实现漏洞（CWE-451）。远程攻击者可通过诱导用户执行特定 UI 手势，配合精心构造的 HTML 页面实施 UI 欺骗攻击，伪造地址栏显示内容误导用户。该漏洞影响 Android 版 Chrome 142.0.7444.137 之前版本，CVSS 3.1 评分 4.2（中危），攻击向量为网络，攻击复杂度高，需用户交互，无需权限，影响机密性低和可用性低。攻击者需诱导用户访问恶意页面并执行特定交互手势才能触发 UI 欺骗，Google 已在 Chrome 142.0.7444.137 版本中修复该漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.2,"aliases":["CVE-2025-12728"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-11-10T20:15:39Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:32:51Z","remediation":"立即将 Google Chrome 升级到 142.0.7444.162 及以上版本，作为主要修复措施。若无法立即更新，可在防火墙中配置应用级过滤，阻止执行特定 UI 交互的危险 HTML 页面。访问 chrome://settings/help 检查当前版本，并启用自动更新功能以确保及时获取安全补丁。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/11/stable-channel-update-for-desktop.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/452392032","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fc5c3e6f60accc24b7eac4fd31472f0e5fd97f24/cves/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12728.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/617f5713eaf60aa312a8e3fe5c9942eeb7cf98ee/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12728.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0c8771e89b9e76278d77bdb22e6a7f5061b52570/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-12728.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/4c26ebbfb2437ed90b3e4375ee155f638be2c4bd/data/2025/CVE-2025-12728.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0c8771e89b9e76278d77bdb22e6a7f5061b52570/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-12728.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-12728.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-12728.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/1c0dfd8c28507756be9a283d40cf1d9bdcdb241c/data/anchore/2025/CVE-2025-12728.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/59bd6fda35498288097a4f1fd0cdf8c04a1d74bd/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-127xx/CVE-2025-12728.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1838da7604055c8895f6f79e31255e78a27012a4/2025/CVE-2025-12728.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0532.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0531","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0531.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-12727","title":"Google Chrome V8 实现不当导致堆缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Google Chrome V8 JavaScript引擎存在实现不当漏洞（CWE-787 越界写入），攻击者可通过诱导用户访问精心构造的恶意HTML页面触发堆损坏，进而可能实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Google Chrome 142.0.7444.137 之前版本，CVSS 3.1 评分 8.8（HIGH），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需权限但需要用户交互、影响机密性/完整性/可用性均为高。攻击者需诱导受害者访问恶意页面即可触发漏洞，Google 已在 Chrome 142.0.7444.137 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-12727"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-11-10T20:15:39Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:32:51Z","remediation":"建议立即升级到 Google Chrome 142.0.7444.137 或更高版本，如无法立即更新，可通过 Windows Update 启用自动更新功能进行补丁安装。如需临时缓解措施，可在防火墙层面阻止不安全的 Web 页面渲染功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/11/stable-channel-update-for-desktop.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/454485895","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-12727.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fc5c3e6f60accc24b7eac4fd31472f0e5fd97f24/cves/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12727.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/617f5713eaf60aa312a8e3fe5c9942eeb7cf98ee/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12727.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0c8771e89b9e76278d77bdb22e6a7f5061b52570/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-12727.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/e2fbb25cf36dd17c3ff796c21d6f98188851fe27/po